{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CdyGB5cEmwokSCTgeHtfb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Response to Ticket\n\n**1. Wire `check:pricing-sync` into the pre-commit hook as a BLOCKING check.**\n\nAdd the check to the pre-commit hook configuration to run `npm run check:pricing-sync` and block commits on failure. This captures the coupling at edit-time, the earliest reliable feedback layer, before changes reach CI or the ship gate—preventing the break from propagating.\n\n**2. DO NOT delete the `pricing-sync` job from CI.**\n\nKeep the CI job as a required gate check. The pre-commit hook guards individual developer edits but does not run on all CI paths (rebases, cherry-picks, force-pushes, or skipped hooks). The CI job remains the authoritative enforcement layer and catches breaks that bypass local tooling; removing it leaves the coupling undefended at the ship gate.\n\n---\n\n**Reasoning:** The hook provides fast feedback and blocks the most common edit path. The CI job provides defense-in-depth and orchestrates final authority. Deleting CI coverage based on local tooling creates a false economy—the coupling has broken three times despite existing checks, so redundancy here is a feature, not waste."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":595,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":257,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}}
